  "description": "Jay's the perfect student. He's got straight As and he's the student body president. But after being coerced into joining the school's biking team, the Hummingbird Crew, he discovers a whole new world outside of studying. What new adventures will he face outside the comfort of his textbooks? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)\n\n*Notes:\n\\- Includes two extra chapters.\n\\- The work was cancelled after it was discovered that the artist had been tracing other people's art.*",
